{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 4, :comments ["<b>ותכלת.</b> Wool dyed in the blood of the חִלָּזוֹן, and its color is green (Menachot 44)." "<b>וארגמן.</b> Wool dyed with a kind of dye whose name is אַרְגָּמָן." "<b>ושש.</b> It is linen." "<b>ועזים.</b> The down of goats — therefore Onkelos renders וּמְעַזֵּי — that which comes from goats — and not goats themselves, for the translation of עִזִּים is עִזַּיָּא."], :book :exodus, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 25, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:54:22.132348127Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}